# Cortex ships markdown and .mjs files verbatim into other people's repositories.
# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) materialises CRLF and the
# installer emits different bytes per platform — for a tool whose whole point is
# committed, shared files, that is a defect. Normalise everything to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
